  "governance_note": "Existing validated evidence is preserved. Custom tangent-axis rotate, semantic-reference-bound operation, bounded BRep through-hole linear pattern/mirror, bounded offset-pivot non-tangent arbitrary-axis face rotate, and one bounded outer-cylindrical nonplanar face radial-offset family all have real FreeCAD/OCCT plus Blender save/reopen receipts and are registered only as bounded capabilities. The cylindrical proof validates only the governed tube/outer-cylinder radial-offset family with inner cylindrical face preservation, adjacent annular-face replacement, bounded tessellation readback and fail-closed wall-collapse/selector/offset guards; it does not establish general curved/freeform face edit parity. Fifteen grandfathered FreeCAD workflows plus three stable CAD dependency/integration baselines remain preserved as evidence but are PR-triggered only on ready_for_review; push-main regression remains enabled. Draft Candidate professional direct-BRep development is owned by the shared Frontier, preventing long-lived-PR path matching from re-running historical professional baselines on every synchronize. The guard inherits project-wide anti-pollution authority from main without forking it, freezes one-off workflow growth, and keeps main as the only installed CURRENT. PR/default-environment promotion remains HOLD until fresh main synchronization, contradiction scan, full regression and explicit promotion decision."
